{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0011_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "74e5adc776f93296b2bf809669abaef4ead54b846ca53a1d5ad44966b6e36cd6", "ja": "あら、ちょうどいい所に。アンタも一緒に……\nじゃなくて、アンタが考えなさいよ。", "zh": "哎呀，来得正好，你也来一起……\n不对，你来想一下啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
