{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0011_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "d1666f08bcba3a56791a01fc2d8f5928dd0c91f9656b06ac6db531a12199cfce", "ja": "戦略を考えていたの。私がかわいくて完璧な\nアイドルっていうのは、もう世界の常識じゃない？", "zh": "我在思考策略。我是既可爱又完美的偶像这件事，\n已经是全世界的常识了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0011_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d27c4f6397f87bd3e5ec2c9b99219a2806cb818a750a039771d9f9d5ba9f4922", "ja": "ちょっと気が早い気がするけど……。\nまあ、そういう面もあるかな。", "zh": "现在想这个好像有点太早了……\n不过算是有这么一回事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0011_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "e7b291fbc77443ae383ec92629038d47c36b19a739189ed4df629f41b75f0450", "ja": "でも、それだけじゃ物足りないのよね～。\nまだ私の魅力の半分も出せてない気がするわ。", "zh": "但光是这样还不够呢～\n我觉得我的魅力连一半都还没展现出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0011_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3a25a449e2e28958f20cbf559c5737e7f785defdd9d68fa09dbf7d0de3cef867", "ja": "じゃ、劇場の子達と一緒に、幅広いジャンルの仕事を\nするとか。よく面倒を見てくれてるみたいだし。", "zh": "那试着和剧场的伙伴们一起从事各类型的工作怎么样？\n毕竟你好像也常帮忙照顾大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0011_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "925de518cbe7f91b52bb341dbe3b1e47a8bd389972b57e8668da27b738689aaa", "ja": "そ、それは……アンタひとりじゃ、\nカバーできないだろうし……。", "zh": "那、那是……因为光靠你一个人，\n一定没办法照顾到所有人嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0011_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "fc47de7dce70cc6d9e893af9e709b3d170ed09cd8c57bd20859d98eba8990e7c", "ja": "って、面倒とかはどうでもいいの！　それならそれで\nいいから、キリキリ仕事を取って来なさいよねっ！", "zh": "不对，照顾什么的不重要啦！\n既然如此就照你说的办，快去努力争取工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
